{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"CueFrame API","description":"CueFrame public REST API. Authenticate with `Authorization: Bearer cf_live_*` / `cf_test_*` keys, or use x402 EIP-3009 payments on priced endpoints. Every endpoint is org-scoped; cross-org access returns 404 (not 403) to avoid leaking resource existence.\n\nSee: https://docs.cueframe.ai","version":"v1","contact":{"name":"CueFrame","url":"https://cueframe.ai","email":"support@cueframe.ai"},"license":{"name":"Apache-2.0","identifier":"Apache-2.0"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.cueframe.ai","description":"Production"}],"tags":[{"name":"media","description":"Media items — uploads, generation, transcripts."},{"name":"clips","description":"Clipping capability — find publishable moments in long-form media (suggestions) and compose from a chosen moment."},{"name":"projects","description":"Projects container + metadata."},{"name":"renders","description":"Render jobs — create, status, stream, cancel, refresh URL."},{"name":"sessions","description":"Multi-angle session recordings + mux."},{"name":"components","description":"Built-in + org-installed components."},{"name":"brand-kits","description":"Org-scoped brand kits (read-only)."},{"name":"webhooks","description":"Outbound webhooks (HMAC-signed, retried, dead-lettered)."},{"name":"health","description":"Unauthenticated health + introspection."},{"name":"skills","description":"Public agent skills (SKILL.md) — discovery + markdown."},{"name":"compose-session","description":"Warm reactive session: render frames, capture stills, and verify (judge-score) a composition in a loop."},{"name":"workspace","description":"One-call editing handle: mint a project + import its source URL in a single request."},{"name":"account"},{"name":"api-keys"},{"name":"billing"},{"name":"briefs"},{"name":"checkpoints"},{"name":"compose"},{"name":"compositions"},{"name":"consult"},{"name":"critics"},{"name":"evidence"},{"name":"exports"},{"name":"fonts"},{"name":"jobs"},{"name":"resources"},{"name":"selector"},{"name":"templates"},{"name":"traces"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"cf_live_* or cf_test_*","description":"API key auth. Prefix `cf_live_` for production orgs, `cf_test_` for sandbox."},"x402":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"PAYMENT-SIGNATURE","description":"x402 v2 payment header (EIP-3009 USDC on Base; base64 PaymentPayload). Returned 402 Payment-Required if absent on priced endpoints."}},"schemas":{"AccountResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"generationLimit":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"applies":{"type":"boolean"},"unit":{"type":"string","const":"cents_of_provider_cost"},"cap":{"type":["number","null"]},"spent":{"type":["number","null"]},"remaining":{"type":["number","null"]}},"required":["applies","unit","cap","spent","remaining"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Separate lifetime generation cap before a credit-pack purchase. Wallet balance is still shared; generation must also fit this remaining provider-cost allowance. null means unknown."},"orgId":{"type":"string","description":"The org this API key is bound to — resolved server-side from the Authorization credential, NEVER from the request body/query."},"displayName":{"description":"Org/customer display name from the billing record; null when not set or unknown.","type":["string","null"]},"plan":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Plan/product id (e.g. free, pro, business, studio)."},"name":{"description":"Plan display name.","type":["string","null"]}},"required":["id","name"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The customer's current base plan/tier. null = unknown (billing not configured, or no active plan resolvable yet)."},"entitlements":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EntitlementEntry"},"description":"Per-feature entitlements keyed by featureId. Covers the billing-gated capabilities: `exports` gates create_render AND generate_media output; `compose` gates compose; `brand_kits` gates create_brand_kit; `resource_import` gates import_resource (a boolean grant: `listUsdPerUnit` 0 — stock search and import cost no credits for a keyed caller); plus ai_tokens/storage/compose_verify/compose_capture/etc. Read `listUsdPerUnit` for what one unit costs before you spend it. Most capabilities are CREDIT-FUNDED — `included` is true and the real limit is `balance`, drawn from the shared wallet named in `fundedBy` (`credits` — generation included; a free org is additionally bounded by a generation cap). So read `balance`, not `included`, to decide whether you can afford a call; `included:false` means the plan genuinely lacks the feature. Check BEFORE a metered call to avoid a mid-workflow 402 billing_required (whose error `details.featureId` names the gating feature)."},"costCeilings":{"type":"object","properties":{"generateMediaUsdPerCall":{"description":"Per-call USD ceiling for generate_media: a generation whose ESTIMATE exceeds this 402s (generation_budget_exceeded) before any spend. Right-size the prompt/duration under this. null = unknown.","type":["number","null"]}},"required":["generateMediaUsdPerCall"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Discoverable per-call cost ceilings so an agent can price/right-size a request before a guaranteed 402."},"billingConfigured":{"type":"boolean","description":"false = billing is not configured in this environment, so plan/entitlement values are best-effort and may be null (unknown), not authoritative."},"surfaces":{"type":"object","properties":{"console":{"type":"string","description":"Origin of the authenticated web console."},"usage":{"type":"string","description":"Browser URL for the usage ledger."},"billing":{"type":"string","description":"Browser URL for plan and credits."},"apiKeys":{"type":"string","description":"Browser URL for minting and revoking API keys."},"project":{"type":"null","description":"No per-project browser view exists yet, so there is no URL to hand a user for a project or its composition. Stated as an explicit null so a client does not construct a route that 404s (CUE-19). Show a rendered frame (preview_frame) or a completed render instead."}},"required":["console","usage","billing","apiKeys","project"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The browser URLs that actually exist, so an agent asked to \"show me\" can hand the user a real link instead of guessing one from an id. A null means the surface is not built, not that it is hidden from this key."}},"required":["generationLimit","orgId","displayName","plan","entitlements","costCeilings","billingConfigured","surfaces"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Account discovery for the authenticated key: identity + plan + entitlements + cost ceilings + the browser surfaces that exist. Read this to see what your plan/credits allow before a metered call (create_render / compose / generate_media / create_brand_kit)."},"EntitlementEntry":{"type":"object","properties":{"featureId":{"type":"string","description":"Stable billing feature id."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable feature name."},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["metered","boolean","credit_system"],"description":"metered = a depleting/gauge quota (has balances); boolean = an on/off plan grant; credit_system = a spendable wallet the metered lines draw from."},"unit":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["cents","count","minutes","gb"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"What `balance`/`includedUsage`/`usage` are COUNTED IN — do not assume. `exports` is output-MINUTES (not a number of renders), `compose`/`ai_tokens`/`compose_verify`/`generate` are CENTS of spend (not a number of calls), `compose_capture` is a count of stills, `storage` is GB, a credit system is cents (1 credit = $0.01). null = boolean feature, nothing to count."},"included":{"description":"Does the CURRENT plan grant this feature? For a credit-funded feature (see `fundedBy`) this is true whenever the plan grants the funding wallet — spend is then bounded by `balance`, not by inclusion. false = not on this plan (a create gated on it 402s billing_required); null = unknown (billing not configured / no live data).","type":["boolean","null"]},"unlimited":{"description":"Metered only: the plan grants an effectively-unlimited allowance. null = unknown / boolean feature.","type":["boolean","null"]},"balance":{"description":"Metered only: remaining balance for the current period, in THIS feature's unit. For a credit-funded feature it is the funding wallet's balance restated at `creditCost` credits per unit — a SHARE of a pool, not a private allowance. null = unknown / boolean feature.","type":["number","null"]},"includedUsage":{"description":"Metered only: the plan's included allowance (the period limit), in this feature's unit. null = unknown / boolean feature.","type":["number","null"]},"usage":{"description":"Metered only: amount consumed this period, in this feature's unit. null = unknown / boolean feature.","type":["number","null"]},"nextResetAt":{"description":"Metered only: epoch-ms when the period balance resets. null = unknown / no scheduled reset.","type":["number","null"]},"fundedBy":{"description":"The credit system that actually pays for this feature (always `credits` — there is one wallet). Non-null means the feature has NO separate allowance: its `balance` restates that shared wallet, and every other feature with the same `fundedBy` competes for the same money. null = the plan grants this feature directly.","type":["string","null"]},"creditCost":{"description":"Credits consumed per ONE unit of this feature (exports 50 = $0.50 per 1080p output-minute; compose_capture 2 = $0.02 per still). null = not credit-funded.","type":["number","null"]},"listUsdPerUnit":{"description":"LIST price in USD of ONE unit of this feature (see `unit`) — the quote to read BEFORE a call. Credit-funded: `creditCost`/100 (exports 0.5 per 1080p output-minute; compose_capture 0.02 per still; compose/ai_tokens/generate 0.015 per cent of provider cost). 0 = the plan grants this feature and it draws NO credits (resource_import: stock search AND import are free for a keyed caller, bytes count toward `storage`; brand_kits). null = not quotable up front (a wallet, a gauge, or a feature the plan does not grant).","type":["number","null"]}},"required":["featureId","name","type","unit","included","unlimited","balance","includedUsage","usage","nextResetAt","fundedBy","creditCost","listUsdPerUnit"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A single feature's entitlement: whether the plan includes it, remaining/limit when metered, and the per-unit list price to quote before a call"},"ApiKeyCreateRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"permissions":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string","enum":["media","sessions","projects","renders","webhooks","billing"]},"additionalProperties":{"minItems":1,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["read","write"]}},"description":"Resource → actions grant. Resources: media, sessions, projects, renders, webhooks, billing. Actions: read, write. Least-privilege — grant only what's needed (billing:write is required to start a checkout)."},"expiresIn":{"description":"Lifetime in seconds; omit for no expiry.","type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"required":["name","permissions"],"additionalProperties":false},"ApiKeyResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string","description":"The full secret key (cf_test_… / cf_live_…). Shown ONCE — store it now."},"id":{"type":"string"},"prefix":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"string","description":"First chars of the key, for later identification."}},"required":["key","id","prefix","start"],"additionalProperties":false},"AudioPaletteEntry":{"type":"object","properties":{"ref":{"type":"string","description":"Placement handle: a pack soundId/bedId, or an org media id."},"role":{"type":"string","enum":["vo","music","sfx","ambience"],"description":"Declared role for mix policy."},"envelopeClass":{"type":"string","enum":["transient","sweep","ambient"],"description":"Coarse envelope shape — the browse grouping."},"description":{"type":"string"},"durationSec":{"type":"number"},"evidence":{"type":"object","properties":{"envelopeClass":{"type":"string","enum":["transient","sweep","ambient"]},"attackMs":{"type":"number"},"spectralCentroidHz":{"type":"number"},"meanVolumeDb":{"type":"number"},"maxVolumeDb":{"type":"number"}},"required":["envelopeClass"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Envelope probe evidence (always carries envelopeClass)."},"source":{"type":"string","enum":["pack","org","generated"],"description":"Provenance discriminant."},"license":{"type":"string","description":"\"CC0\" (pack), \"org-owned\"/a CC token (org), or \"generated\"."},"provenance":{"type":"string","description":"Human-legible provenance (pack attribution / org-owned / generator + prompt)."},"bpm":{"description":"Tempo — present for music-role entries.","type":"number"},"mood":{"description":"Editorial mood tags — present for pack music beds.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["ref","role","envelopeClass","description","durationSec","evidence","source","license","provenance"],"additionalProperties":false},"BillingPlanEntry":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Billing catalog product id (e.g. pro, pro_yearly)."},"tier":{"type":"string","description":"Plan tier: pro | business | studio."},"name":{"type":"string"},"interval":{"type":"string","description":"month | year."},"priceUsd":{"type":"number","description":"Price in USD for the interval."}},"required":["id","tier","name","interval","priceUsd"],"additionalProperties":false},"BillingPlansResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"plans":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BillingPlanEntry"},"description":"Every purchasable {tier, interval} and its product id."},"billingConfigured":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["plans","billingConfigured"],"additionalProperties":false},"BrandKitCreateRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"kitId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"tagline":{"type":"string","maxLength":500},"secondaryTagline":{"type":"string","maxLength":500},"colors":{"type":"object","properties":{"primary":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"secondary":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"accent":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"background":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"required":["primary","secondary","accent","background","text"],"additionalProperties":false},"extraColors":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"hex":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"label":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"usage":{"type":"string"}},"required":["hex","label"],"additionalProperties":false}},"headingFont":{"type":"object","properties":{"fontFamily":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"fontWeight":{"type":"number"}},"required":["fontFamily","fontWeight"],"additionalProperties":false},"bodyFont":{"type":"object","properties":{"fontFamily":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"fontWeight":{"type":"number"}},"required":["fontFamily","fontWeight"],"additionalProperties":false},"voiceGuidelines":{"type":"string","maxLength":5000},"syncCaptions":{"type":"boolean"},"captionProfile":{"type":"object","properties":{"fontFamily":{"type":"string"},"fontSize":{"type":"number"},"fontWeight":{"type":"number"},"color":{"type":"string"},"highlightColor":{"type":"string"},"backgroundColor":{"type":"string"},"plate":{"type":"string","enum":["glass","solid","none"]},"position":{"type":"string","enum":["top","center","bottom"]},"textTransform":{"type":"string","enum":["none","uppercase"]},"entrance":{"type":"string","enum":["none","fade","word-pop","stagger-up"]},"entranceMs":{"type":"number"},"entranceStaggerMs":{"type":"number"},"exitMs":{"type":"number"},"emphasisColor":{"type":"string"},"emphasisScale":{"type":"number"},"emphasisFontFamily":{"type":"string"},"emphasisFontWeight":{"type":"number"},"emphasisFontStyle":{"type":"string","enum":["normal","italic"]},"emphasisTextTransform":{"type":"string","enum":["none","uppercase"]},"emphasisLetterSpacing":{"type":"number"},"emphasisPlate":{"type":"boolean"},"emphasisPlateColor":{"type":"string"},"emphasisPlateTextColor":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"motion":{"type":"object","properties":{"duration":{"type":"number"},"easing":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["linear","ease","ease-in","ease-out","ease-in-out"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"cubic-bezier"},"x1":{"type":"number"},"y1":{"type":"number"},"x2":{"type":"number"},"y2":{"type":"number"}},"required":["kind","x1","y1","x2","y2"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"entrance":{"type":"string","enum":["none","fade","word-pop","stagger-up"]},"staggerMs":{"type":"number"},"exitMs":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false},"logo":{"type":"object","properties":{"src":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"alt":{"type":"string"},"placement":{"type":"string","enum":["tl","tr","bl","br"]},"sizePct":{"type":"number"}},"required":["src"],"additionalProperties":false},"intro":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["card","video"]},"src":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"title":{"type":"string"},"subtitle":{"type":"string"},"durationMs":{"type":"number"}},"required":["kind"],"additionalProperties":false},"outro":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["card","video"]},"src":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"title":{"type":"string"},"subtitle":{"type":"string"},"durationMs":{"type":"number"}},"required":["kind"],"additionalProperties":false},"watermark":{"type":"object","properties":{"src":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"opacity":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"placement":{"type":"string","enum":["tl","tr","bl","br"]}},"required":["src"],"additionalProperties":false},"spacing":{"type":"object","properties":{"base":{"type":"number"},"lg":{"type":"number"},"sm":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false},"sizing":{"type":"object","properties":{"fontSizeHeading":{"type":"number"},"fontSizeBody":{"type":"number"},"fontSizeLabel":{"type":"number"},"borderRadius":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false},"audio":{"type":"object","properties":{"sfxIntensity":{"type":"string","enum":["off","light","standard","dense"]},"musicEnabled":{"type":"boolean"},"musicMood":{"type":"string","maxLength":300},"sonicLogo":{"description":"A brand sound signature bound to the intro/outro bookend. `ref` = a palette reference; bound only when the kit carries the matching bumper (intro/outro), else a non-blocking advisory.","type":"object","properties":{"ref":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"placement":{"type":"string","enum":["intro","outro","both"]},"offsetMs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":10000}},"required":["ref","placement"],"additionalProperties":false},"uiSoundSet":{"description":"Per-family SFX overrides (the brand's own tick/pop/…). Highest-priority tier over the org palette + pack default in the compose SFX draw.","type":"object","properties":{"tick":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"pop":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"impact":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"confirm":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"error":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"whoosh":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"riser":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"bedStyle":{"description":"Preferred music bed (`bedId`) or a style hint (`genre` / `bpmRange`). Surfaced for driving agents; compose does not auto-select a pack bed.","type":"object","properties":{"bedId":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"genre":{"type":"string","maxLength":120},"bpmRange":{"type":"object","properties":{"min":{"type":"number"},"max":{"type":"number"}},"required":["min","max"],"additionalProperties":false}},"additionalProperties":false},"ambiencePreference":{"description":"Preferred ambience bed (`{ref}`) or explicit null (opt-out). Surfaced for driving agents; compose has no ambience auto-placement.","anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"ref":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"required":["ref"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}]}},"additionalProperties":false},"exemplarKeys":{"maxItems":24,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"contactSheetKey":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"motifs":{"maxItems":24,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":40},"observed":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":500},"body":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"card"},"html":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"tokens":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["kind","html"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"overlay"},"primitiveId":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"params":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["kind","primitiveId"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"component"},"componentId":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"props":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["kind","componentId"],"additionalProperties":false}],"type":"object"},"motion":{"type":"object","properties":{"preset":{"type":"string","enum":["fade-up","slide-in-left","slide-in-right","scale-pop","stagger-reveal"]},"enterMs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":5000},"exitMs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":5000},"staggerMs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":2000},"confidence":{"type":"string","enum":["high","low"]}},"required":["preset"],"additionalProperties":false},"role":{"type":"string","enum":["title-card","stat","lower-third","pull-quote","hero","logo-tag","enumeration","sequence","comparison"]},"zone":{"type":"object","properties":{"x":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"},"w":{"type":"number"},"h":{"type":"number"}},"required":["x","y","w","h"],"additionalProperties":false},"evidence":{"maxItems":24,"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"diffScore":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"coverage":{"type":"string","enum":["reproduced","approximated","skipped"]},"skipReason":{"type":"string","maxLength":300}},"required":["id","observed","body","role","coverage"],"additionalProperties":false}},"styleRubric":{"type":"string","maxLength":4000},"density":{"type":"object","properties":{"graphicsPerMin":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":60},"maxSimultaneous":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":6}},"required":["graphicsPerMin","maxSimultaneous"],"additionalProperties":false},"inspiration":{"type":"object","properties":{"sources":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":24,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"extractedAt":{"type":"number"},"extractionVersion":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":60}},"required":["sources","extractedAt","extractionVersion"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["kitId","name","colors","headingFont","bodyFont"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"POST /brand-kits body. Org/user are server-resolved; never accepted from the body."},"BrandKitExemplarsRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"motifId":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":12}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"POST /brand-kits/{id}/exemplars body — select which exemplar frames to presign."},"BrandKitExemplarsResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"exemplars":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"index":{"type":"integer","minimum":-9007199254740991,"maximum":9007199254740991},"url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["index","url"],"additionalProperties":false}},"contactSheetUrl":{"type":"string"}},"required":["exemplars"],"additionalProperties":false},"BrandKitListResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BrandKitResponse"}},"pagination":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PaginationMeta"}},"required":["data","pagination"],"additionalProperties":false},"BrandKitResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":["string","null"]},"tagline":{"type":["string","null"]},"colors":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}},"extraColors":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"fonts":{"type":"object","properties":{"heading":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"family":{"type":"string"},"weight":{"type":["number","string"]}},"required":["family"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}]},"body":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"family":{"type":"string"},"weight":{"type":["number","string"]}},"required":["family"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["heading","body"],"additionalProperties":false},"voiceGuidelines":{"type":["string","null"]},"captions":{"type":"object","properties":{"sync":{"type":"boolean"},"profile":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["sync","profile"],"additionalProperties":false},"motion":{"type":"object","properties":{"duration":{"type":"number"},"easing":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["linear","ease","ease-in","ease-out","ease-in-out"]},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"cubic-bezier"},"x1":{"type":"number"},"y1":{"type":"number"},"x2":{"type":"number"},"y2":{"type":"number"}},"required":["kind","x1","y1","x2","y2"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"entrance":{"type":"string","enum":["none","fade","word-pop","stagger-up"]},"staggerMs":{"type":"number"},"exitMs":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false},"logo":{"type":"object","properties":{"src":{"type":"string"},"alt":{"type":"string"},"placement":{"type":"string","enum":["tl","tr","bl","br"]},"sizePct":{"type":"number"}},"required":["src"],"additionalProperties":false},"intro":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["card","video"]},"src":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string"},"subtitle":{"type":"string"},"durationMs":{"type":"number"}},"required":["kind"],"additionalProperties":false},"outro":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["card","video"]},"src":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string"},"subtitle":{"type":"string"},"durationMs":{"type":"number"}},"required":["kind"],"additionalProperties":false},"watermark":{"type":"object","properties":{"src":{"type":"string"},"opacity":{"type":"number"},"placement":{"type":"string","enum":["tl","tr","bl","br"]}},"required":["src"],"additionalProperties":false},"spacing":{"type":"object","properties":{"base":{"type":"number"},"lg":{"type":"number"},"sm":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false},"sizing":{"type":"object","properties":{"fontSizeHeading":{"type":"number"},"fontSizeBody":{"type":"number"},"fontSizeLabel":{"type":"number"},"borderRadius":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false},"audio":{"type":"object","properties":{"sfxIntensity":{"type":"string","enum":["off","light","standard","dense"]},"musicEnabled":{"type":"boolean"},"musicMood":{"type":"string","maxLength":300},"sonicLogo":{"description":"A brand sound signature bound to the intro/outro bookend. `ref` = a palette reference; bound only when the kit carries the matching bumper (intro/outro), else a non-blocking advisory.","type":"object","properties":{"ref":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"placement":{"type":"string","enum":["intro","outro","both"]},"offsetMs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":10000}},"required":["ref","placement"],"additionalProperties":false},"uiSoundSet":{"description":"Per-family SFX overrides (the brand's own tick/pop/…). Highest-priority tier over the org palette + pack default in the compose SFX draw.","type":"object","properties":{"tick":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"pop":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"impact":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"confirm":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"error":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"whoosh":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"riser":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"bedStyle":{"description":"Preferred music bed (`bedId`) or a style hint (`genre` / `bpmRange`). Surfaced for driving agents; compose does not auto-select a pack bed.","type":"object","properties":{"bedId":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"genre":{"type":"string","maxLength":120},"bpmRange":{"type":"object","properties":{"min":{"type":"number"},"max":{"type":"number"}},"required":["min","max"],"additionalProperties":false}},"additionalProperties":false},"ambiencePreference":{"description":"Preferred ambience bed (`{ref}`) or explicit null (opt-out). Surfaced for driving agents; compose has no ambience auto-placement.","anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"ref":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"required":["ref"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}]}},"additionalProperties":false},"exemplarKeys":{"maxItems":24,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"contactSheetKey":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"motifs":{"maxItems":24,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":40},"observed":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":500},"body":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","cons