n` + `out` ≤ the segment's duration (endSec − startSec): the two edges share the span, so to ramp across the WHOLE segment set one edge to the full duration and the other to 0. Omit for an instant cut to this framing.","type":"object","properties":{"in":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"description":"Ease-IN ramp DURATION in seconds at the segment START."},"out":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"description":"Ease-OUT ramp DURATION in seconds at the segment END."}},"required":["in","out"],"additionalProperties":false},"bias":{"description":"Optional FINE framing nudge off the focus center, source-normalized in [−0.3, 0.3]. A small correction (headroom, rule-of-thirds), NOT a reframe — use `focus`/`zoom` for the actual shot. Omit (treated as 0) to sit dead-center on the focus.","type":"object","properties":{"x":{"type":"number","minimum":-0.3,"maximum":0.3,"description":"Horizontal nudge, source-normalized (+ = right)."},"y":{"type":"number","minimum":-0.3,"maximum":0.3,"description":"Vertical nudge, source-normalized (+ = down)."}},"required":["x","y"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["startSec","endSec","focus"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["segments"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["kind","mediaId"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","const":"component"},"componentId":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"props":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"assets":{"description":"Manifest asset slot → project media id. At mount each slot arrives as `assets[slot].handle`, a fetchable URL for <Img>/<Video>/<Audio>; `props` becomes `params` and never carries an asset URL.","type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"additionalProperties":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"assetTiming":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"additionalProperties":{"type":"object","properties":{"trimStartSec":{"type":"number","minimum