escription":"Your card's HTML — rendered VERBATIM as the graphic (shell motion via applyMotionPreset in a FOLLOWING call). CANVAS CONTRACT: the card renders in a viewport equal to the composition format's pixel frame (1080×1920 at 9:16 fhd); the root is NOT auto-pinned — declare explicit width/height matching the frame (box-sizing:border-box) and anchor content with flex/grid; position:absolute;inset:0 on the root does NOT fill the frame; for edge-to-edge backgrounds add an inner absolutely-positioned layer with generous negative inset. Overlay compositing applies a ~92% safe-area inset — keep critical copy away from the extreme edges. FONTS: name a family from GET /v1/fonts (list_render_fonts) — the renderer loads those faces for the card and waits for them, so `font-family: Inter` draws Inter. `@import` and remote font files are REFUSED: the card renders with no network. A family that is not on that list has no bytes behind it and the browser falls back, so end any stack with a generic (`Inter, sans-serif`) rather than relying on a system face being present."},"tokens":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}},"zPlane":{"type":"string","const":"front"}},"required":["kind","html"],"additionalProperties":false}],"type":"object"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["video","audio","image","overlay","effect"]},"opacity":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"scale":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0},"rotation":{"type":"number"},"position":{"type":"object","properties":{"x":{"type":"number","minimum":-1,"maximum":2},"y":{"type":"number","minimum":-1,"maximum":2}},"required":["x","y"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Clip CENTRE as a fraction of the frame: {x:0.5,y:0.5} is dead centre, 0 to 1 is inside the frame, and a little overshoot (down to -1, up to 2) is how an entrance starts off-canvas. NOT pixels: the renderer maps x to `left: x*100%`, so `x: 180` sits 180 frame-widths away and draws nothing."},"