ull when none reported."},"result":{"anyOf":[{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PreviewFrameJobResult"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComponentPreviewJobResult"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VerifyJobResult"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExtractBrandKitResponse"}]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Kind-specific payload when status is `succeeded`; null otherwise."},"error":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"code":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"}},"required":["code","message"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Stable failure code + human message when status is `failed`; null otherwise. `job_timeout` = the executor died mid-run and the stall sweep reaped the job — re-enqueue to retry."},"createdAt":{"type":"string"},"updatedAt":{"type":"string"},"completedAt":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["id","jobKey","kind","status","progress","result","error","createdAt","updatedAt","completedAt"],"additionalProperties":false},"PreviewFrameJobResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"geometry":{"type":"object","properties":{"scale":{"type":"number"},"compositionWidth":{"type":"number"},"compositionHeight":{"type":"number"},"width":{"type":"number"},"height":{"type":"number"}},"required":["scale"],"additionalProperties":false},"warnings":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"previewed":{"type":"object","properties":{"source":{"type":"string","enum":["inline","scratch","persisted"]},"compositionId":{"type":"string"},"etag":{"type":"string"}},"required":["source"],"additionalProperties":false},"listUsd":{"description":"List price charged for this delivered capture.","type":"number"},"artifacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"beatSec":{"type":"number"},"bytes":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"contentType":{"type":"string","enum":["image/png","image/jpeg"]},"layers":{"type":"objec