,"enum":["interactive","standard","background"]},"intent":{"type":"string","enum":["preview","final"]},"brandKitId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","minLength":1},{"type":"null"}]}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"POST /projects/:id/renders body."},"RenderFontsResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"manifestVersion":{"type":"string","description":"Identifies this exact face table. Derived from the table's own content, so it moves when and only when the admitted set moves. Record it beside a composition to state which face table a font choice was validated against."},"families":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"family":{"type":"string","description":"The family name authoring accepts VERBATIM — card, caption and scene text alike."},"weights":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"min":{"type":"number"},"max":{"type":"number"}},"required":["min","max"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"The weights a shipped file declares. A static face has min === max; a variable face gives its declared wght axis range. Any weight inside a range renders; anything outside every range is REFUSED, never synthesised."},"styles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["normal","italic"]},"description":"The styles bytes exist for in this family. Request italic only when this list includes 'italic'; the renderer refuses synthetic slant."},"captionDefaults":{"type":"object","properties":{"base":{"type":"number"},"emphasis":{"type":"number"}},"required":["base","emphasis"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The weights a caption is drawn at when the style names none."},"origin":{"type":"string","enum":["bundled","aliased"],"description":"'bundled' = bytes ship in the render bundle. 'aliased' = a metric-compatible binary stands in for the named family."}},"required":["family","weights","styles","captionDefaults","origin"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["manifestVersion","families"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"GET /fonts response — the renderer's admitted font set. Derived from the same table the font gate refuses by, so any family/weight/style here passes validation by construction. Covers the BUNDLED set only: a brand kit's sealed faces are per-org and per-render."},"RenderListResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RenderResponse"}},"pagination":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PaginationMeta"}},"required":["data","pagination"],"additionalProperties":false},"RenderResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["queued","pending","rendering","complete","error","cancelled"]},"progress":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RenderProgress"},"outputUrl":{"type":["string","null"]},"outputExpiresAt":{"type":["string","null"]},"error":{"description":"Human-readable failure message. Pair with `errorCode` for a stable, machine-readable code an agent runner can branch on.","type":["string","null"]},"errorCode":{"description":"Stable, machine-readable error code (e.g. `render_pipeline_unavailable`, `render_route_missing`, `render_pipeline_failed`). Null when status is not `error` or unavailable for an older render.","type":["string","null"]},"errorDetails":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Structured failure context — `{ targetUrl?, upstreamStatus?, upstreamCode?, attemptedAt? }`. Surfaced so agent runners can distinguish operator-config issues from upstream-down vs route-missing without parsing `error`."},"category":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["authoring","transient","internal"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Failure taxonomy when status is `error`; null otherwise. `authoring` = deterministic defect in YOUR composition/request — fix it, retrying is futile; `transient` = temporary pipeline/infra failure — safe to retry_render; `internal` = unexpected server fault — r