description":"Payment required. Returned when the caller presents no API key on a priced operation: the body AND the `Payment-Required` header carry the x402 v2 challenge (accepted scheme, network, USDC asset, amount, payTo). Sign the EIP-3009 authorization and retry with a `PAYMENT-SIGNATURE` header. A KEYED caller sees this status instead when their plan lacks or has exhausted the feature (`billing_required`).","headers":{"Payment-Required":{"description":"Base64 x402 v2 PaymentRequired envelope — the same challenge as the body, for clients that read it off the header.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/X402PaymentRequired"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden — permission insufficient.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"Unprocessable — invalid_composition / media_in_use / session_in_use / render_not_cancellable.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limited. Retry-After header present.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string"},"in":"path","name":"id","required":true}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USDC","amount":"10000"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]}}},"/v1/composition/validate":{"post":{"operationId":"validateComposition","tags":["compositions"],"summary":"Validate a composition body without saving it (dry-run)","description":"Dry-run the FULL save-time authoring guard set against a Composition body WITHOUT persisting it and without a project. Runs the same pure, DB-free guards saveComposition enforces — wire shape, primitive membership (unknown_primitive / custom_missing_sourcecode), required-param shape (invalid_primitive_params), clip↔track family (clip_source_track_mismatch), reframe coverage (reframe_coverage_gap), and font admission (font_not_reproducible: a caption/param face that is neither bundled nor sealed in a brand font asset) — and returns ONE shape, `200 { valid, errors[] }`, for BOTH wire-shape and deep-invariant failures (no 400-vs-200 split). `valid:false` lists every authoring error (sanitized envelopes) to fix before save/render. The ONLY checks NOT run here are the two DB-bound ones — trim-bounds (media duration) and image/asset-on-video-track (media kind) — which can only be caught at save/render.","security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"x402":[]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Composition"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Validation verdict (ALWAYS 200 for a JSON body — both wire-shape and deep-invariant failures). `valid:false` lists authoring errors (envelopes) to fix before save/render; `valid:true` means the composition passes every pure save-time guard.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"contract":{"type":"string","description":"The contract this verdict was computed against (the kernel version the deployment runs). If it differs between two calls, the validator changed, not your composition."},"valid":{"type":"boolean"},"errors":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"code":{"type":"string"},"stage":{"type":"string"},"category":{"type":"string"},"retryable":{"type":"boolean"},"message":{"type":"string"},"fix":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["code","stage","category","retryable","message"],"additionalProperties":false}},"advisories":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"rule":{"type":"string"},"criterion":{"type":"string"},"clipId":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"},"fix":{"type":"string"}},"required":["rule","criterion","detail","fix"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Deterministic, render-free QUALITY floors (the SAME named defects the Director's in-loop verify and score_composition surface: static-hold, caption-spine, sfx-density, sfx-speech-collision, bed-coverage, audio-role). NON-blocking — they never flip `valid` (an editorially-weak composition still renders); fix them for quality, not to save. Empty when the composition is clean or the wire shape failed (they need a parsed composition)."},"warnings":{"description":"Non-blocking render-fidelity warnings detected before enqueue, including unavailable font families.","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"quote":{"type":"object","properties":{"thisStepUsd":{"type":"number"},"jobSpendSoFarUsd":{"type":"number"},"estimatedJourneyTotalUsd":{"type":"number"}},"required":["thisStepUsd","jobSpendSoFarUsd","estimatedJourneyTotalUsd"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The A2 money triple for the commodity lane: validate is free; estimatedJourneyTotalUsd is the render price to finish from a valid composition — relay it BEFORE create_render."}},"required":["contract","valid","errors","advisories","quote"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad request — validation_error / invalid_cursor / invalid_query.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid Authorization header.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. Returned when the caller presents no API key on a priced operation: the body AND the `Payment-Required` header carry the x402 v2 challenge (accepted scheme, network, USDC asset, amount, payTo). Sign the EIP-3009 authorization and retry with a `PAYMENT-SIGNATURE` header. A KEYED caller sees this status instead when their plan lacks or has exhausted the feature (`billing_required`).","headers":{"Payment-Required":{"description":"Base64 x402 v2 PaymentRequired envelope — the same challenge as the body, for clients that read it off the header.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/X402PaymentRequired"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limited. Retry-After header present.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USDC","amount":"10000"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]}}},"/v1/projects/{id}/compositions/{compositionId}":{"delete":{"operationId":"deleteComposition","tags":["compositions"],"summary":"Delete a composition","description":"Delete a composition and its version history. REFUSES the project's ACTIVE composition (409 composition_active) — make another one active first, or delete the project.","security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-permissions":{"projects":["write"]},"responses":{"204":{"description":"Deleted."},"400":{"description":"Bad request — validation_error / invalid_cursor / invalid_query.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid Authorization header.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. Returned when the caller presents no API key on a priced operation: the body AND the `Payment-Required` header carry the x402 v2 challenge (accepted scheme, network, USDC asset, amount, payTo). Sign the EIP-3009 authorization and retry with a `PAYMENT-SIGNATURE` header. A KEYED caller sees this status instead when their plan lacks or has exhausted the feature (`billing_required`).","headers":{"Payment-Required":{"description":"Base64 x402 v2 PaymentRequired envelope — the same challenge as the body, for clients that read it off the header.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/X402PaymentRequired"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden — permission insufficient.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"409":{"description":"Conflict — stale_etag / idempotency_conflict / suggestions_already_complete.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limited. Retry-After header present.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"parameters":[{"schema":{"type":"string"},"in":"path","name":"id","required":true},{"schema":{"type":"string"},"in":"path","name":"compositionId","required":true}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USDC","amount":"10000"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]}}},"/v1/media/search":{"get":{"operationId":"searchLibrary","tags":["media"],"summary":"Semantic search over the org's own footage","description":"Find MOMENTS in your library by describing what they look like. The query uses the same visual-semantic index as the footage, so it matches on visual content — \"wide shot of a speaker at a whiteboard\", \"hands on a keyboard\", \"city skyline at dusk\" — including shots nobody talks about (which is where transcript search fails). Results are time-ranged: feed `mediaId` + `startSec`/`endSec` straight into apply_composition as a clip. `q` is required; `limit` defaults to 10 and caps at 25. `indexing` is COVERAGE, not emptiness: it is true whenever some of the org's footage is not in the visual index yet (media that predates it, or still processing), and it can be true ALONGSIDE results — then read them as \"the best moments among what we have looked at so far\". Empty `results` with `indexing: true` is a state, not a failure; re-run the item through processing to index it. The first search after an idle period can take up to ~90s; subsequent searches are typically faster.","security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-permissions":{"media":["read"]},"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","required":true,"description":"What the moment should look like, in plain language. Describe the IMAGE, not the words spoken.","schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Maximum moments to return. Default 10, maximum 25.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":25,"default":10}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Matching moments, best first.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LibrarySearchResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad request — validation_error / invalid_cursor / invalid_query.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid Authorization header.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. Returned when the caller presents no API key on a priced operation: the body AND the `Payment-Required` header carry the x402 v2 challenge (accepted scheme, network, USDC asset, amount, payTo). Sign the EIP-3009 authorization and retry with a `PAYMENT-SIGNATURE` header. A KEYED caller sees this status instead when their plan lacks or has exhausted the feature (`billing_required`).","headers":{"Payment-Required":{"description":"Base64 x402 v2 PaymentRequired envelope — the same challenge as the body, for clients that read it off the header.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"conten