nd moves only when the admitted set does. Covers the BUNDLED set only — a brand kit's sealed faces are per-org and per-render.","security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"x402":[]}],"x-permissions":{"media":["read"]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The renderer's admitted font faces.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RenderFontsResponse"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid Authorization header.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. Returned when the caller presents no API key on a priced operation: the body AND the `Payment-Required` header carry the x402 v2 challenge (accepted scheme, network, USDC asset, amount, payTo). Sign the EIP-3009 authorization and retry with a `PAYMENT-SIGNATURE` header. A KEYED caller sees this status instead when their plan lacks or has exhausted the feature (`billing_required`).","headers":{"Payment-Required":{"description":"Base64 x402 v2 PaymentRequired envelope — the same challenge as the body, for clients that read it off the header.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/X402PaymentRequired"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden — permission insufficient.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limited. Retry-After header present.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal error.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}},"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USDC","amount":"10000"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]}}},"/v1/projects/{id}/renders":{"post":{"operationId":"createRender","tags":["renders"],"summary":"Create a render job","description":"Render the project's composition to a finished MP4. Async: returns a render id; poll GET /pr